<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL dual currency bonds AAA long-term.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL dual currency bonds AAA long-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Friday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA to the Deutsche Siedlungs- und Landesrentenbank (DSL Bank) dual currency yen/A$ bonds first series -- 30 billion yen 5.7 percent bonds 1998 issue.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
